OL,3,GWest Midlands
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FA fine end
OL,6,Fto the day with some evening sunshine.
OL,7,FClear spells overnight, though some
OL,8,Fareas of low cloud, mist and fog will
OL,9,Freform under the light winds. Another
OL,10,Fwarm and muggy night.
OL,11,
OL,12,CWednesday:FWednesday looks fine. Early
OL,13,Flow cloud, mist of fog clearing to
OL,14,Fleave plenty of sunshine. However,
OL,15,Ffurther cloud edging in from the
OL,16,Fnorthwest during the day. Hot and
OL,17,Ffeeling humid.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
