OL,3,GWest Midlands
OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Thursday to Saturday:
OL,6,FThursday will be fresher with sunshine
OL,7,Fand perhaps the odd shower. Mostly dry
OL,8,Fon Friday and Saturday with further
OL,9,Fsunshine developing at times. Still
OL,10,Fwarm in the sunshine.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
